        <summary>
          <para>This request is for manual capture use case where the applications want to directly control the capture parameters.</para>
          <para>For example, the application may wish to manually control android.sensor.exposureTime, android.sensor.sensitivity, etc.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraMetadata#CONTROL_CAPTURE_INTENT_MANUAL" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraMetadata.CONTROL_CAPTURE_INTENT_MANUAL</code>.</a></format></para>
