      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>This request is for a motion tracking use case, where the application will use camera and inertial sensor data to locate and track objects in the world.</para>
          <para>The camera device auto-exposure routine will limit the exposure time of the camera to no more than 20 milliseconds, to minimize motion blur.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraMetadata#CONTROL_CAPTURE_INTENT_MOTION_TRACKING" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraMetadata.CONTROL_CAPTURE_INTENT_MOTION_TRACKING</code>.</a></format></para>
